MODE [m]
  This slot's screen mode (its console cleared at the new size); each slot
  has its own.
  MODE        the mode now, and the modes
  MODE m      2 (80 x 25), S (80 x 24 and a status strip), W (88 x 23),
              UW (96 x 21), P (64 x 32), F (MON's full screen)
  Programs get the size with BDOS 49 (CP/M 3's system control block).
